    "detailed_description": "This is a 2D side-scrolling adventure game with a nostalgic pixel art style. You and your friend will play as two cats with different abilities, embarking on an exciting journey across a mysterious and unfamiliar continent.<br><br>You must work together, using your unique skills, to traverse majestic snowy mountains, dangerous waterfalls, solve numerous puzzles, and defeat strange and unusual enemies. We hope you enjoy a fun and relaxing time in this magical world, experiencing the joy of cooperation and adventure.<br><br>Join the black and white cats and embark on this journey filled with challenges and surprises!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057720/extras/6c81380e9acfbeddc51026f232c735cf.poster.avif?t=1749946369\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057720/extras/6c81380e9acfbeddc51026f232c735cf.webm?t=1749946369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057720/extras/6c81380e9acfbeddc51026f232c735cf.mp4?t=1749946369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Nostalgic 2D pixel art style, immersing players in a beautiful pixelated world.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cooperative two-player mode, with each cat having different skills and abilities, requiring teamwork to overcome various difficulties and challenges.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than ten diverse character states, including falling, getting wet, and flying, fully capturing the fun of being a cat.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unexpected traps that force you to find ways to solve puzzles.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hidden areas full of surprises, where you can take a moment to enjoy the tranquility.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057720/extras/1c3584a39a68677d6e8b49fad707372a.poster.avif?t=1749946369\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057720/extras/1c3584a39a68677d6e8b49fad707372a.webm?t=1749946369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057720/extras/1c3584a39a68677d6e8b49fad707372a.mp4?t=1749946369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
